commit 6d538555cb151d4121ed51a27db81890eacf8ae9

TypeScript source stays in this directory and is linted/formatted with the
rest of the repo. Oxlint loads the tsdown build via `@getpie/oxlint/anti-slop`
and `@getpie/oxlint/anti-slop-effect` so plugins work on Node versions that
cannot import `.ts` (this repo's Cloud Agent image is Node 22.14; CI uses
Node 24).

Rebuild with `pnpm turbo run build --filter=@getpie/oxlint`.
